            "review_title": "Review at Mirai",
            "review_text": "Mit D\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam7 contributions\n0\nBest ramen I've ever tried\nSep 2014 • Friends\nI've tried ramen and udon in many countries (well, it's a pity that I haven't traveled to Japan yet) and this one is the best so far. So tasty, so many choices. Matcha green tea is highly recommended also, real taste. The owner is Japanese - Vietnamese who owned restaurants in Japan as well, she's so nice to talk to.\nThe restaurant is cozy, located right in the center with motorbike parking. Price is very reasonable compared to other Japanese restaurants (~3.5-4usd for ramen/udon, 2usd for gyoza, ~3.5usd for sushi, ~10-15usd for hotpot).\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten October 4, 2014",
